parameters.help_en:
The list of feature configurations that you want to set. Note the following configuration limits:
The product of the number of domain names and the number of features specified by Functions must be less than or equal to 20. For example:
If the number of features specified by Functions is 20, you can specify only one domain name at a time.
If the number of features specified by Functions is 1, you can specify up to 20 domain names at a time.

The format is as follows:

functionName (feature name, required): For configurable features, see https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/388460.html. Separate multiple parameters with commas (,).
argName (parameter name, required): The configuration items of functionName. You can configure multiple configuration items.
argValue (parameter value, required): The values of the configuration items of functionName.
parentid (rule condition ID, optional): By configuring the condition (rule engine) function in https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/388460.html, you can create rule conditions. Rule conditions can match and filter user requests by identifying various parameters carried in user requests. After each rule condition is created, a corresponding https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/388994.html is generated. The configid can be referenced as the ParentId parameter by other feature functions. This way, rule conditions can be combined with feature configurations to form more flexible configurations.

If parentId is set to -1, the existing rule conditions in the configuration are deleted.
```[{
   "functionArgs": [{
     "argName": "Feature parameter A", 
     "argValue": "Value of feature parameter A"
    }, 
  {
    "argName": "Feature parameter B", 
    "argValue": "Value of feature parameter B"
     }], 
 "functionName": "Feature name",
 "parentId": Optional. The configid of the referenced rule condition.
}]
```
Example configuration without using parentId:
When using the origin_request_header function to add a back-to-origin HTTP request header with a reference to the rule condition configid=222728944812032, the request parameters are as follows:
```[{
        "functionArgs": [{
            "argName": "header_operation_type",
            "argValue": "add"
        }, {
            "argName": "header_name",
            "argValue": "Accept-Encoding"
        }, {
            "argName": "header_value",
            "argValue": "gzip"
        }, {
            "argName": "duplicate",
            "argValue": "off"
        }],
        "functionName": "origin_request_header"
}]
```
Example configuration using parentId:
When using the origin_request_header function to add a back-to-origin HTTP request header with a reference to the rule condition configid=222728944812032, the request parameters are as follows:
```[{
        "functionArgs": [{
            "argName": "header_operation_type",
            "argValue": "add"
        }, {
            "argName": "header_name",
            "argValue": "Accept-Encoding"
        }, {
            "argName": "header_value",
            "argValue": "gzip"
        }, {
            "argName": "duplicate",
            "argValue": "off"
        }],
        "functionName": "origin_request_header",
        "parentId": 222728944812032
}]
```
Example configuration for removing the parentId reference from a feature configuration that already uses parentId:
The origin_request_header function has already referenced the rule condition configid=222728944812032 when adding a back-to-origin HTTP request header. To remove the reference to the rule condition, the request parameters are as follows:
```[{
        "functionArgs": [{
            "argName": "header_operation_type",
            "argValue": "add"
        }, {
            "argName": "header_name",
            "argValue": "Accept-Encoding"
        }, {
            "argName": "header_value",
            "argValue": "gzip"
        }, {
            "argName": "duplicate",
            "argValue": "off"
        }],
        "functionName": "origin_request_header",
        "parentId": -1
}]
```

parameters.help_zh:
需要设置的功能配置列表。注意以下配置限制：
域名数量 乘以 Functions 数量，小于等于 20。例如：
如果单次配置的Functions 数量为20，那么单次只能传1个域名。
如果单次配置的Functions 数量为1，那么单次可以传20个域名。

格式如下：

functionName（功能名称，必填）：可配置功能请参见https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/388460.html，多个参数之间用半角逗号（,）分隔。
argName（参数名称，必填）：functionName的配置项（可配置多个配置项）。
argValue（参数值，必填）：functionName的配置项的取值。
parentid（规则条件ID，非必填）：通过配置https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/388460.html中的功能函数**condition**（规则引擎），可以创建出规则条件（规则条件可以通过识别用户请求中携带的各种参数来匹配和过滤用户请求），每一个规则条件被创建以后都会生成一个对应的https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/388994.html，configid可以被当作ParentId参数被其他功能函数引用，这样规则条件就可以与功能配置一起组合形成更灵活的配置。

parentId为 -1：表示删除该配置里面已有的规则条件。
```[{
   "functionArgs": [{
     "argName": "功能参数A", 
     "argValue": "功能参数A对应的值"
    }, 
  {
    "argName": "功能参数B", 
    "argValue": "功能参数B对应的值"
     }], 
 "functionName": "功能名称",
 "parentId": 选填项，对应引用规则条件的configid
}]
```
不使用parentId的情况下，配置示例如下：
使用函数origin_request_header添加回源HTTP请求头的时候引用了configid=222728944812032的规则条件，请求参数如下：
```[{
        "functionArgs": [{
            "argName": "header_operation_type",
            "argValue": "add"
        }, {
            "argName": "header_name",
            "argValue": "Accept-Encoding"
        }, {
            "argName": "header_value",
            "argValue": "gzip"
        }, {
            "argName": "duplicate",
            "argValue": "off"
        }],
        "functionName": "origin_request_header"
}]
```
使用parentId的情况下，配置示例如下：
使用函数origin_request_header添加回源HTTP请求头的时候引用了configid=222728944812032的规则条件，请求参数如下：
```[{
        "functionArgs": [{
            "argName": "header_operation_type",
            "argValue": "add"
        }, {
            "argName": "header_name",
            "argValue": "Accept-Encoding"
        }, {
            "argName": "header_value",
            "argValue": "gzip"
        }, {
            "argName": "duplicate",
            "argValue": "off"
        }],
        "functionName": "origin_request_header",
        "parentId": 222728944812032
}]
```
对一个已经使用了parentId的功能配置删除对parentId的引用，配置示例如下：
函数origin_request_header添加回源HTTP请求头的时候已经引用了configid=222728944812032的规则条件，现在要删掉对规则条件的引用，请求参数如下：
```[{
        "functionArgs": [{
            "argName": "header_operation_type",
            "argValue": "add"
        }, {
            "argName": "header_name",
            "argValue": "Accept-Encoding"
        }, {
            "argName": "header_value",
            "argValue": "gzip"
        }, {
            "argName": "duplicate",
            "argValue": "off"
        }],
        "functionName": "origin_request_header",
        "parentId": -1
}]
```
